@MedicalAppointments.Patients.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7163

### Listar pacientes (paginado y filtrable)
GET {{MedicalAppointments.Patients.Api_HostAddress}}/c?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Obtener paciente por ID
GET {{MedicalAppointments.Patients.Api_HostAddress}}/c/1
Accept: application/json

### Listar contactos de emergencia
GET {{MedicalAppointments.Patients.Api_HostAddress}}/EmergencyContacts?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Contactos de emergencia de un paciente
GET {{MedicalAppointments.Patients.Api_HostAddress}}/patients/1/emergency-contacts?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json
